Practical 10
Tag Helpers in ASP.NET Core are server-side components that allow developers to create
HTML elements using simple and readable HTML-like syntax in Razor Views. They make it
easier to generate dynamic HTML and connect HTML elements with server-side models and
controllers. Tag Helpers reduce the need to write complex HTML and Razor code manually,
improve readability, and make ASP.NET Core web applications easier to develop and
maintain.
Creating an Application Using Razor Pages and Tag Helpers
